<title>JAPAN: Furubayashi Shiko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Furubayashi Shiko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.66		vs		8.25</p>
<p> Operating	   28 millio	  vs	     331 million</p>
<p> Current		6 million	 vs	     208 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 24 million	 vs	prft 103 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 1.35 yen	  vs	 prft  5.87 yen</p>
<p> Shares		18 million	 vs		18 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs		 2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Furubayashi Shiko Co Ltd is an integrated maker of printed paperboard containers for packaging.</p>
</text>
